.TH CALAMARES-LOGS-HELPER 8 "November 2026" "NexusOS 0.2" "NexusOS"
.SH NAME
calamares-logs-helper \- copy installer logs into the installed system
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B calamares-logs-helper
.I target-root
.SH DESCRIPTION
Called by the installer at the end of an installation. Copies the Calamares session log,
the live medium information, the casper log and the boot journal to
\fItarget-root\fR/var/log/installer, together with a compressed copy of the installed
package list. Logs are readable by root only.
